<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: advanced ballistic missile body -->
  <DMSE_MissileBody_AdvancedBallistic.label>先進彈道導彈彈體</DMSE_MissileBody_AdvancedBallistic.label>
  <!-- EN: A modern multi-stage strategic missile. It climbs to the edge of space, then drops its warhead onto a single building rather than a whole district.\n\nAssembled directly in a strategic silo or on a launch tower, and never exists as an item. -->
  <DMSE_MissileBody_AdvancedBallistic.description>一種現代多節戰略導彈。它會爬升到太空邊緣，再把彈頭投向單一建築，而不是一整個街區。\n\n直接在戰略發射井或發射塔上裝配，不會以物品形式存在。</DMSE_MissileBody_AdvancedBallistic.description>
  <!-- EN: Strategic -->
  <DMSE_MissileBody_AdvancedBallistic.designWord>戰略</DMSE_MissileBody_AdvancedBallistic.designWord>
  
  <!-- EN: advanced cruise missile body -->
  <DMSE_MissileBody_AdvancedCruise.label>先進巡航導彈彈體</DMSE_MissileBody_AdvancedCruise.label>
  <!-- EN: A modern stealthy cruise missile airframe. It hugs the terrain on the way in and is far more accurate than the older Scorer missile.\n\nHas slots for a warhead, guidance, propulsion and payload. -->
  <DMSE_MissileBody_AdvancedCruise.description>一種現代匿蹤巡航導彈彈體。沿地形低空飛行，精度遠勝舊式的射門手導彈。\n\n可裝配彈頭、導引、推進與酬載。</DMSE_MissileBody_AdvancedCruise.description>
  <!-- EN: Cruise -->
  <DMSE_MissileBody_AdvancedCruise.designWord>巡航</DMSE_MissileBody_AdvancedCruise.designWord>
  
  <!-- EN: advanced general-purpose missile body -->
  <DMSE_MissileBody_AdvancedLight.label>先進通用導彈彈體</DMSE_MissileBody_AdvancedLight.label>
  <!-- EN: A compact multi-role missile airframe. It is small enough for portable and vehicle launchers, yet more accurate and able to carry more than older light missiles.\n\nHas slots for a warhead, guidance and payload. -->
  <DMSE_MissileBody_AdvancedLight.description>一種小型多用途導彈彈體。小到能裝上攜行式與車載發射器，精度與載重卻都勝過舊式輕型導彈。\n\n可裝配彈頭、導引與酬載。</DMSE_MissileBody_AdvancedLight.description>
  <!-- EN: Multirole -->
  <DMSE_MissileBody_AdvancedLight.designWord>多用途</DMSE_MissileBody_AdvancedLight.designWord>
  
  <!-- EN: legacy ballistic missile body -->
  <DMSE_MissileBody_LegacyBallistic.label>老式彈道導彈彈體</DMSE_MissileBody_LegacyBallistic.label>
  <!-- EN: An early liquid-fueled ballistic rocket. It is slow to prepare and wildly inaccurate, but it can be built from industrial materials long before modern guidance exists.\n\nAssembled directly on a launch tower or in a silo. -->
  <DMSE_MissileBody_LegacyBallistic.description>一種早期的液態燃料彈道火箭。準備時間長、精度極差，但在現代導引技術出現之前，就能用工業材料造出來。\n\n直接在發射塔或發射井上裝配。</DMSE_MissileBody_LegacyBallistic.description>
  <!-- EN: Legacy -->
  <DMSE_MissileBody_LegacyBallistic.designWord>老式</DMSE_MissileBody_LegacyBallistic.designWord>
  
  <!-- EN: legacy interceptor loitering munition -->
  <DMSE_MissileBody_LegacyInterceptor.label>老式攔截巡飛彈彈體</DMSE_MissileBody_LegacyInterceptor.label>
  <!-- EN: An early guided interceptor with four oversized fins and a radio command link. After launch it circles over the target area until an operator steers it onto an incoming threat. It is slow, short-ranged and inaccurate, but it is a true guided interceptor.\n\nComes in a fixed configuration and cannot be customized. -->
  <DMSE_MissileBody_LegacyInterceptor.description>一種早期的導引攔截彈，配有四片超大尾翼與無線電指令鏈路。發射後會在目標空域盤旋，直到操作員把它引向來襲目標。速度慢、射程短、命中率低，但確實是一種導引攔截武器。\n\n固定構型，無法改裝。</DMSE_MissileBody_LegacyInterceptor.description>
  
  <!-- EN: legacy loitering munition -->
  <DMSE_MissileBody_LegacyLoiter.label>老式巡飛彈彈體</DMSE_MissileBody_LegacyLoiter.label>
  <!-- EN: An early pulsejet loitering munition flown along a preset heading by a clockwork autopilot. It is slow, loud and inaccurate, but simple enough to build from little more than steel and fuel.\n\nComes in a fixed configuration and cannot be customized. -->
  <DMSE_MissileBody_LegacyLoiter.description>一種早期的脈衝噴射巡飛彈，由發條式自動駕駛儀沿預設航向飛行。速度慢、噪音大、精度差，但結構簡單，幾乎只靠鋼材與燃料就能造出來。\n\n固定構型，無法改裝。</DMSE_MissileBody_LegacyLoiter.description>
  
  <!-- EN: ground-attack missile body -->
  <DMSE_MissileBody_Maverick.label>對地攻擊導彈彈體</DMSE_MissileBody_Maverick.label>
  <!-- EN: A light ground-attack missile airframe, built to put a heavy warhead on a single target.\n\nHas slots for a warhead, guidance and payload. -->
  <DMSE_MissileBody_Maverick.description>一種輕型對地攻擊導彈彈體，用來把重型彈頭準確送到單一目標上。\n\n可裝配彈頭、導引與酬載。</DMSE_MissileBody_Maverick.description>
  <!-- EN: Strike -->
  <DMSE_MissileBody_Maverick.designWord>對地</DMSE_MissileBody_Maverick.designWord>
  
  <!-- EN: supersonic anti-ship missile body -->
  <DMSE_MissileBody_Moskit.label>超音速反艦導彈彈體</DMSE_MissileBody_Moskit.label>
  <!-- EN: A ramjet-powered supersonic anti-ship missile. It skims the sea on its final approach, leaving close-in defenses only seconds to react.\n\nHas slots for a warhead, guidance, propulsion and payload. Comes with an anti-ship radar seeker. -->
  <DMSE_MissileBody_Moskit.description>一種衝壓引擎推進的超音速反艦導彈。末段貼著海面飛行，近迫防禦只剩幾秒鐘能反應。\n\n可裝配彈頭、導引、推進與酬載，出廠時配備反艦雷達尋標器。</DMSE_MissileBody_Moskit.description>
  <!-- EN: Supersonic -->
  <DMSE_MissileBody_Moskit.designWord>超音速</DMSE_MissileBody_Moskit.designWord>
  
  <!-- EN: advanced anti-ship cruise missile body -->
  <DMSE_MissileBody_Oniks.label>先進反艦巡航導彈彈體</DMSE_MissileBody_Oniks.label>
  <!-- EN: An advanced anti-ship cruise missile with a rocket booster and a ramjet cruise stage. It is faster, harder to detect and longer-ranged than older supersonic designs, and it fires from inclined launchers and vertical launch silos alike.\n\nHas slots for a warhead, guidance, propulsion and payload. Comes with an anti-ship radar seeker. -->
  <DMSE_MissileBody_Oniks.description>一種以火箭助推、衝壓引擎巡航的先進反艦巡航導彈。比舊式超音速導彈更快、更難偵測、射程也更遠，傾斜發射架與垂直發射井都能發射。\n\n可裝配彈頭、導引、推進與酬載，出廠時配備反艦雷達尋標器。</DMSE_MissileBody_Oniks.description>
  <!-- EN: Sea-Skimming -->
  <DMSE_MissileBody_Oniks.designWord>掠海</DMSE_MissileBody_Oniks.designWord>
  
  <!-- EN: advanced surface-to-air missile body -->
  <DMSE_MissileBody_Sparrow.label>先進防空導彈彈體</DMSE_MissileBody_Sparrow.label>
  <!-- EN: A slender semi-active radar-homing missile. It keeps following the fire-control radar's signal even through hard turns, making it a much more accurate interceptor than older missiles.\n\nHas slots for a warhead, guidance and payload. -->
  <DMSE_MissileBody_Sparrow.description>一種細長的半主動雷達導引導彈。即使在急轉彎時也能持續追隨火控雷達的訊號，攔截命中率遠高於舊式導彈。\n\n可裝配彈頭、導引與酬載。</DMSE_MissileBody_Sparrow.description>
  <!-- EN: Area SAM -->
  <DMSE_MissileBody_Sparrow.designWord>區域防空</DMSE_MissileBody_Sparrow.designWord>
  
  <!-- EN: light surface-to-air missile body -->
  <DMSE_MissileBody_Stinger.label>輕型防空導彈彈體</DMSE_MissileBody_Stinger.label>
  <!-- EN: A slim, man-portable heat-seeking anti-air missile. It has a short range and a small warhead, and is a less accurate interceptor than a full-size missile, but it fits in almost any launcher.\n\nHas slots for a warhead and guidance. -->
  <DMSE_MissileBody_Stinger.description>一種纖細的攜行式紅外線防空導彈。射程短、彈頭小，攔截精度也不如大型防空導彈，但幾乎任何發射器都裝得下。\n\n可裝配彈頭與導引。</DMSE_MissileBody_Stinger.description>
  <!-- EN: SAM -->
  <DMSE_MissileBody_Stinger.designWord>防空</DMSE_MissileBody_Stinger.designWord>
  
  <!-- EN: tactical ballistic missile body -->
  <DMSE_MissileBody_Tochka.label>戰術彈道導彈彈體</DMSE_MissileBody_Tochka.label>
  <!-- EN: A solid-fuel tactical ballistic missile. It is more accurate and much quicker to prepare than early rockets, but its range falls well short of a strategic missile.\n\nHas slots for a warhead, guidance, propulsion and payload. Comes with inertial guidance. -->
  <DMSE_MissileBody_Tochka.description>一種固態燃料戰術彈道導彈。比早期火箭更準、準備也快得多，但射程遠不及戰略導彈。\n\n可裝配彈頭、導引、推進與酬載，出廠時配備慣性導引。</DMSE_MissileBody_Tochka.description>
  <!-- EN: Tactical -->
  <DMSE_MissileBody_Tochka.designWord>戰術</DMSE_MissileBody_Tochka.designWord>
  
  <!-- EN: hypersonic anti-ship missile body -->
  <DMSE_MissileBody_Yj.label>高超音速反艦導彈彈體</DMSE_MissileBody_Yj.label>
  <!-- EN: A hypersonic anti-ship missile with a rocket booster and a ramjet cruise stage. Its small radar signature and very low final approach give defenders little time to respond.\n\nHas slots for a warhead, guidance, propulsion and payload. Comes with an anti-ship radar seeker. -->
  <DMSE_MissileBody_Yj.description>一種以火箭助推、衝壓引擎巡航的高超音速反艦導彈。雷達訊號小、末段飛得極低，防禦方幾乎沒有反應時間。\n\n可裝配彈頭、導引、推進與酬載，出廠時配備反艦雷達尋標器。</DMSE_MissileBody_Yj.description>
  <!-- EN: Hypersonic -->
  <DMSE_MissileBody_Yj.designWord>極超音速</DMSE_MissileBody_Yj.designWord>
  
</LanguageData>